About the commented code
# input_date=json.dumps(input_data)
# print(input_date)

This was likely used for testing the JSON data before sending it. There is also a small naming typo: input_date would be better named input_data or input_json.

Since you are using:

predictor.serializer = JSONSerializer()

you normally do not need to manually use json.dumps(), because the serializer handles the conversion.

